diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index e3207bd..50a092b 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Added strikethrough: `~~text~~` renders as `<del>text</del>`.
 - Fixed a `RecursionError` crash on very deeply nested quotes or lists; nesting deeper than 32 levels now raises `MarkliteError`.
 - The table of contents lists heading levels 1 and 2 by default (`toc_max_level` was 3).
 - Double quotes in text content are no longer written as `&quot;`; attribute values still escape them.
diff --git a/docs/reference.md b/docs/reference.md
index bb3b1e6..46dcf9b 100644
--- a/docs/reference.md
+++ b/docs/reference.md
@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ Fields of `marklite.Options`, with their defaults.
 |---|---|---|
 | `*text*` | `<em>text</em>` | `_text_` too, but not inside a word. |
 | `**text**` | `<strong>text</strong>` | `__text__` too. |
+| `~~text~~` | `<del>text</del>` | Exactly two tildes on each side; a single `~` is literal. |
 | `[text](url)` | `<a href="url">text</a>` | An optional `"title"` follows the URL. |
 | `![alt](url)` | `<img src="url" alt="alt" />` | The alt text is the plain text of the label. |
 | `[TOC]` | `<nav class="toc">` | A paragraph holding only the marker becomes the table of contents. |
